The turn/block trace model, the trace-source and unit abstraction, the
indexing tiers, and the overlapping content-addressed chunker in
internal/trace/ are ported from funes' Rust implementation to Go.
Modifications: the port targets a Layer/turbopuffer namespace rather than a
local Lance dataset, and omits funes' embedding, reranking and rank-fusion
stages, which run in the store.
